{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_60","type":"agent_message","text":"The full regression exposed two P0 cross-run defects: the browser reservation test reused a durable email from an earlier passing run, and the production build did not copy the candidate-level `public/assets`, so the real GLB request correctly ended in `3d_unavailable`. I’m recording both before edits. The repair is limited to a unique per-run test identity and Vite’s `publicDir`; renderer logic, API duplicate semantics, and model bytes remain unchanged."}}
